        "original_id": "374a7877-4afc-510f-a06e-0d266175ae57",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cleo Demetriou, Sophia Kiely, Kay Purcell, Ameerah Falzon-Ojo, Sophia Dall'aglio, Kerry Ingram, Eleanor Worthington Cox\n- Works: So Awkward, Mache Man, Made of Paper, Tracy Beaker Returns, The Dumping Ground, Emmerdale, Waterloo Road\n- Roles: Lily Hampton, Jas Salford, Martha Fitzgerald, Mrs Rennison, Gina Conway, Cynthia Daggert, Candice Smilie\n\nFacts:\n- Cleo Demetriou played Lily Hampton in the CBBC show \"So Awkward\".\n- \"So Awkward\" stars Cleo Demetriou as Lily Hampton, Ameerah Falzon-Ojo as Jas Salford, and Sophia Dall'aglio as Martha Fitzgerald.\n- Cleo Demetriou sang the soundtrack song \"Made of Paper\" for the short film \"Mache Man\".\n- Sophia Kiely shared a role with Cleo Demetriou, Kerry Ingram, and Eleanor Worthington Cox.\n- Kay Purcell is an English actress.\n- Kay Purcell played Gina Conway in \"Tracy Beaker Returns\" and its spin-off series \"The Dumping Ground\".\n- Kay Purcell played Cynthia Daggert in \"Emmerdale\".\n- Kay Purcell appeared as a passenger in a former Malaysia Airlines safety video.\n- Kay Purcell played Mrs Rennison in \"So Awkward\".\n- Kay Purcell played Candice Smilie in \"Waterloo Road\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
